+## Hosted numerical compute and accelerators (Iteration 50)
+
+The platform includes a replaceable hosted-compute contract at `drop-in/hosted-compute/` and a browser-first Google Colab notebook at [`notebooks/PAP_Hosted_Compute_Backends.ipynb`](notebooks/PAP_Hosted_Compute_Backends.ipynb). Open [Google Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/) and use **File → Upload notebook**, or use the repository's direct Colab GitHub link once its actual owner/name/branch are configured. The notebook probes available CPU/GPU/TPU libraries and emits a hash-bearing simulation result for validation by the canonical platform contract.
+
+See `BUILD-ANALYSIS-ITERATIONS-47-50.md`, `TEST-COVERAGE-MATRIX-ITERATION-50.md`, and `HANDOFF-ITERATION-50.md`. Hosted compute remains SIMULATION evidence; it does not claim HIL, physical verification or L5 fidelity.
